pbwinput 1
# Phase 4's route, its first piece (oracle.py's SEQUENCES: hugh; port/tools/oracle/README.md, "The comparison
# sequences"): from the starter save (starter_save_b2_us.pbwinput), CONTINUE at the Aspertia City lookout, Hugh's
# arrival and his challenge, and his trainer battle, Tepig against Oshawott, A every 16 frames for FIGHT and Tackle: its
# first turn and the second's choices, up to the second turn's rolls (count 8193), where the battle parts from melonDS's
# by construction: Hugh's AI thinks within 500 ticks of the CPU a pass, which takes the DS two passes more than the
# port, and picks its move with another number (README.md, "Known differences"). The presses are the ones the Route 19
# save played to there before the route was cut into pieces (README.md, "Saves"), with the clock pinned, which the
# bottom screen shows, and the random seeds the DS builds here (oracle.py seeds hugh). Positions are zone (x, z) tiles;
# counts are GFL's frame count (sVBlankCount). On game frames. Black 2.
version b2_us
clock pinned
seed 0x5a0af77416c50a14  # GFL's, at start-up (oracle frame 20)
